          "id": "a1-01-l3-e02",
          "stage": "learn",
          "title": "Essere: noi, voi, loro",
          "body": "The plural forms of **essere**:\n\n| persona | essere |\n|---|---|\n| noi | ==siamo== |\n| voi | ==siete== |\n| loro | ==sono== |\n\n> **Sono** means *I am* and *they are*. The context tells you which.",
          "examples": [
